# Files are LF in the working tree on every system. Some tests compare bytes (the generated
# component reference, formatted project files) and exports must not depend on a checkout's
# core.autocrlf: a Windows clone otherwise turns docs/components.md into CRLF and the demo test fails.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.bmp binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.icns binary
*.zip binary
*.dmg binary
